ge, and Tier B independence confirmed | 2026-06-13.md | 2026-06-16 |\n| [[concepts/baylor-load-simulator-deployment]] | Baylor Load Simulator Vercel deployment; now includes the 2026-05-12 Comparison View feature and Catapult period-aggregation sync findings | 2026-04-14.md, 2026-04-24.md, 2026-05-12.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/skylar-zinnecker-cmj-rtc-reports]] | CMJ return-to-competition HTML reports for athlete Skylar Zinnecker, built from a VALD ForceDecks export, with redefined baseline and \"Post-Op Low\" terminology | 2026-04-14.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/catapult-token-friction-across-baylor-projects]] | Recurring Catapult OpenField token friction linking the Baylor Load Simulator deploy, the Tezino sync failure, and the Catapult API reference | 2026-04-14.md, 2026-06-10.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/vald-forcedecks-cmj-data-across-projects]] | Shared VALD ForceDecks CMJ data and mRSI metric linking Skylar Zinnecker's RTC reports to the Tezino narrative backfill | 2026-04-14.md, 2026-06-10.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/sportscience-research-repo-batch-import]] | Round-7 batch import + data-quality repair; now records the \"verify prior background agents actually finished\" procedural lesson from 2026-04-22 | 2026-04-21.md, 2026-04-22.md, 2026-04-24.md | 2026-08-06 |\n| [[concepts/graphify-vault-separation]] | Decision to move graphify's 300+ generated files out of SportScienceResearchRepo and into the user's Obsidian vault | 2026-04-21.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/obsidian-vault-as-knowledge-hub]] | Obsidian SecondBrain as recurring knowledge destination: graphify cleanup, /ingest-resource skill, morning briefing durable copy, and Applied Performance OKR hub as canonical project home | 2026-04-21.md, 2026-06-10.md, 2026-05-21.md, 2026-06-01.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/the-monitor-newsletter]] | \"The Monitor\" newsletter Issue 01 production: content verification, staff photo integration, preview-server rendering gotcha, and templ