e-capture as the only true out-of-sample ground truth | 2026-08-01.md | 2026-08-01 |\n| [[connections/substitute-a-primitive-when-the-layer-is-unreliable]] | A lying layer and a silent layer both resolve by dropping to a trusted primitive instead of trusting or debugging the suspect tool | adjudicated | 2026-08-02 |\n| [[connections/contaminated-baselines-distort-load-narratives]] | A reference/baseline window contaminated with out-of-scope data silently rewrites the clinical load narrative in ACWR and CMJ reports | adjudicated | 2026-08-02 |\n| [[connections/step-down-to-ground-truth-when-the-surface-lies]] | CRLF phantom diffs and hallucinated agent output both demand distrusting the intermediate layer and verifying at ground truth | adjudicated | 2026-08-02 |\n| [[connections/dont-baseline-on-the-injured-state]] | Injury-return baselines/control limits must be drawn from healthy data, with injured-state data kept only as forensic overlays | adjudicated | 2026-08-02 |\n| [[concepts/athletics-performance-landing-page-spec]] | Baylor Athletics Performance landing-page spec/PRD for a Claude Design POC: single scrolling page, recruits-first, §7 placeholder-slot discipline, grounded in the 7/16 Silas Newby Fireflies meeting | 2026-07-21.md | 2026-08-02 |\n| [[concepts/worktree-remote-merge-verification]] | Merging a PR from a feature-branch worktree fails locally because the main checkout owns main; the GitHub squash-merge still lands and syncs via fast-forward pull — verify the remote, not the local swap | 2026-07-21.md | 2026-08-02 |\n| [[concepts/forceplate-decisionsystem-metric-reliability]] | Adds symposium-transcript provenance and Cam Josse attribution correction to the reliability/classifier pass | 2026-07-22.md | 2026-08-07 |\n| [[concepts/risk-stratification-engine-availability-hazard]] | Risk_Stratification_Engine discrete-time availability hazard model: CV ROC-AUC 0.65–0.68, top-decile lift 1.9–2.5×, prior lower-limb injury dominant, feature-block ablation 