ory documentation | 2026-04-22.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/verify-before-trusting-tool-output]] | Links a 2026-04-22 agent-citation-hallucination fix and a newsletter photo-rendering gotcha as instances of \"verify directly, don't trust the intermediate layer\" | 2026-04-22.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/perch-weight-room-domain-feature]] | Perch/Weight Room domain feature, now including its 2026-04-25 data-activation completion (436 athletes, 12,300 set records ingested via corrected Perch API integration) | 2026-04-24.md, 2026-04-25.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/subagent-driven-development]] | Two-stage review methodology (spec-compliance then code-quality) used to implement and verify Perch/Weight Room Task 9 | 2026-04-24.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/jinja2-none-safety-pattern]] | Jinja2's `default()` filter unreliably handles `None`; use explicit `is not none` guards instead | 2026-04-24.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/multi-stage-review-catches-agent-blind-spots]] | Multi-stage review principle extended to planning context: spec self-review catching carryover resolution behavioral gap | 2026-04-22.md, 2026-04-24.md, 2026-05-21.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/perch-api-integration-reference]] | Verified Perch API integration details (Bearer auth, /v3/sets pagination, 1RM formula, exercise/org IDs) that completed the Weight Room domain's data-activation step | 2026-04-25.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[connections/api-credential-assumptions-can-be-backwards]] | Links a 2026-04-25 Perch auth-scheme surprise (Bearer worked, JWT didn't) to the 2026-06-10 Catapult token failure as mirror-image \"credential appearance is unreliable\" lessons | 2026-04-25.md, 2026-06-10.md | 2026-06-15 |\n| [[concepts/baylor-load-simulator-comparison-view]] | Projected-vs-Actual ComparisonChart on /practices/[id]/compare, planned /comparison nav tab, single-metric scope; now cross-linked to the Color Triad Intended↔Realized leg | 2026-05-12.md | 2026-08-06 |\n| [[concepts/catapu