hots into Claude Code; paste with `Ctrl+V` not `Cmd+V`, capture with `Cmd+Ctrl+Shift+4`, drag-from-Finder fallback | 2026-08-10.md | 2026-08-11 |\n| [[connections/vendor-action-bypasses-os-setting]] | A vendor's named convenience action may reimplement rather than wrap an OS capability, silently voiding OS-level configuration; bind the primitive instead | 2026-08-10.md | 2026-08-11 |\n| [[concepts/claude-code-permission-modes]] | Adds the mode-before-permission diagnostic (a silent auto-mode refusal may just be a missing prompt) and cross-links the `.claude/` edit-block precedent | 2026-08-11.md | 2026-08-14 |\n| [[concepts/crashbox-ssd-backup-baseline]] | First full CRASHBOX SSD baseline (OK, 0 errors); mid-run volume rename is safe under rsync incremental resume; only the git push leg needs network and self-heals nightly | 2026-08-11.md | 2026-08-11 |\n| [[concepts/machine-restore-closeout-handoff]] | Machine-restore closeout: committed handoff note, Zotero MCP user-scope registration, self-draining 54-log compiler backlog, PR monitors left stopped, three parked items carried forward | 2026-08-11.md | 2026-08-11 |\n| [[connections/narrowest-sufficient-escalation-over-blanket-bypass]] | Blocked actions should be resolved at the narrowest rung (mode switch, `!` one-off) — frequency not risk selects the rung; links the diskutil rename block to the Startup-folder gate | 2026-08-11.md | 2026-08-11 |\n| [[concepts/codex-path-rewrite-incident]] | Adds the re-ask-for-authorization-after-diagnosis-change observation alongside the 235-occurrence scope and stale-checkout root cause | 2026-08-08.md | 2026-09-01 |\n| [[concepts/committed-symlink-repo-landmine]] | 21 skill symlinks committed in the wrong repo as mode 120000 with self-referential targets; `core.symlinks=false` inherited from Windows re-materializes them as 29-byte text files on every checkout/reset/stash | 2026-08-08.md | 2026-08-11 |\n| [[concepts/pre-destructive-git-backup-discipline]] | Per-step tarball snaps